          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(pin (num \"12\") (name \"PH0\")) (pin (num \"13\") (name \"PH1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The FCC's external crystal is not connected to its HSE pins, so the MCU may fail to start or run from the intended 25 MHz clock.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "components": ["FCC1", "UART3_FCC1"],
      "pins": ["FCC1.48", "FCC1.73", "UART3_FCC1.3", "UART3_FCC1.4"],
      "nets": ["UART3_TX_FCC", "UART3_RX_FCC"],
      "observed": "The two FCC1 pins identified as VCAP are connected directly to UART3 connector pins: FCC1.48 (VCAP) shares UART3_TX_FCC with UART3_FCC1.3, and FCC1.73 (VCAP) shares UART3_RX_FCC with UART3_FCC1.4.",
      "expected": "VCAP pins should have the MCU-required capacitor connections, not be routed to UART connector signals.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"UART3_RX_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"73\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC1\") (pin \"4\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"UART3_TX_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"48\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC1\") (pin \"3\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The UART3 connector is not connected to UART signals, and external signaling on those pins can interfere with or damage the MCU's internal core-regulator supply.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomalies are present: both MCUs have unconnected supply pins, the FCC crystal is routed to GPIO pins rather than its HSE pins, and the FCC VCAP pins are routed to the UART3 connector."
}

